Algorithm

Algorithm: Book Allocation

Input:
    Array arr[] containing pages of N books
    M = number of students

Step 1:
    If M > N:
        Return -1

Step 2:
    Initialize:
        start = maximum element of arr[]
        end = sum of all elements of arr[]
        ans = -1

Step 3:
    While start <= end:

        mid = start + (end - start) / 2

        count = 1
        page = 0

        Step 4:
        For i = 0 to N-1:

            page = page + arr[i]

            If page > mid:
                count = count + 1
                page = arr[i]

        Step 5:
        If count <= M:
            ans = mid
            end = mid - 1

        Else:
            start = mid + 1

Step 6:
    Return ans
